>\n<caption>공동이용 시설설치 계획</caption>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width:27%\"/>\n<col style=\"width:27%\"/>\n<col style=\"width:27%\"/>\n<col style=\"width:19%\"/>\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">시설의 종류</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">위치</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">면적(㎡)</th>\n<th class=\"last\" scope=\"col\">비고</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt40\">\n<h3 class=\"u-tit01\">기존 건축물의 개량에 관한 계획</h3>\n<div class=\"rspvn-box-wrap ty980\">\n<div class=\"rspvn-box\">\n<span class=\"bodrTop-line\"></span>\n<table class=\"tbl_st03\">\n<caption>기존 건축물의 개량에 관한 계획 </caption>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width:19%\"/>\n<col style=\"width:27%\"/>\n<col style=\"width:27%\"/>\n<col style=\"width:27%\"/>\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"last\" colspan=\"4\" scope=\"col\">정비개량 계획(동)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"borNo\">\n<th scope=\"col\">계</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">존치</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">개수</th>\n<th class=\"last\" scope=\"col\">철거후 신축</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td class=\"last\">1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt40\">\n<h3 class=\"u-tit01\">정비사업시행 예정시기</h3>\n<div class=\"rspvn-box-wrap ty980\">\n<div class=\"rspvn-box\">\n<span class=\"bodrTop-line\"></span>\n<table class=\"tbl_st03\">\n<caption>이 표는 정비사업시행 예정시기 게시판의 표로 정비사업시행 예정시기로 구성되어 있습니다.</caption>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width:30%\"/>\n<col style=\"width:70%\"/>\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"top\">\n<th>정비사업시행 예정시기</th>\n<td class=\"tl\">2009. 06월</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"complementary_request-cont\">\n<div class=\"tr\">\n<a class=\"bt-btn dk-grey\" href=\"javascript:writeRequest();\"><span>보완요청하기</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"line-box\"></div>\n<!-- s : subCon -->\n<form id=\"openDataWriteCheckForm\" method=\"post\" name=\"openDataWriteCheckForm\">\n\n\n\n\n\n</form>\n<div id=\"layer_recptnList\">\n<div class=\"layer_recptnList_cont\" id=\"layer_recptnList_cont\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display:none;\">\n<iframe id=\"recptnList_frame\" style=\"border:none;width:100%;height:300px;\" title=\"이 페이지에서 프레임을 사용합니다.\"></iframe>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"inputRequest\" style=\"display:none;\" title=\"보완요청\">\n\n<div class=\"inner-pop\" id=\"popupWrap\">\n<div class=\"rel-box\">\n<div class=\"pop-conts\">\n<h3 class=\"u-tit01\" id=\"popupTitle\">보완 요청 등록</h3>\n<p class=\"u-txt01 fw-600\">※ 보완요청시 주의사항</p>\n<p class=\"u-txt01\">추진위/조합의 기본정보(조직도, 사무실주소/전화번호, 협력업체, 위치도, 추진경과) 보완요청을 하는 곳입니다.</p>\n<ul class=\"dot-list01\">\n<li>요청하신 사항이 아래와 같은 경우 요청이 반려됩니다.\r\n\t                \r\n\t                <ul class=\"das-list01\">\n<li>공개자료에 미비사항이 없음에도 불구하고 보완요청을 하는 경우</li>\n<li>요청기재내용이 포괄적 요구 / 부정확 / 애매모호한 경우</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<form action=\"\" id=\"sumrySuppForm\" method=\"post\" name=\"sumrySuppForm\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n<div class=\"rspvn-box-wrap ty980\">\n<div class=\"rspvn-box mt25\">\n<span class=\"bodrTop-line\"></span>\n<table class=\"tbl_st01 form_tbl\" summary=\"보완요청 등록 게시판\">\n<caption>이 표는 보완요청 등록의 표로 선택, 자료분류, 요청분류, 제목, 보완필요사유로 구성되어 있습니다.</caption>\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"19%\"/>\n<col width=\"28%\"/>\n<col width=\"19%\"/>\n<col width=\"34%\"/>\n</colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">분류</th>\n<td id=\"resultNoticeTypeCodeNm\"></td>\n<th class=\"last\" scope=\"col\">대상항목</th>\n<td class=\"last\" id=\"dataSjCode\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">보완필요사유</th>\n<td class=\"last\" colspan=\"3\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>결과통보방법</th>\n<td class=\"last\" colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<span id=\"resultNoticeTypeCodeStr\"></span>\n<br/>※ SMS와 이메일 통보는 정비사업 정보몽땅 사용자가본정보에서 SMS/메일링 수신을 선택한 경우 제공되며, 연락처와 이메일주소가 정확하지 않을 경우 SMS/이메일 통보가 되지 않을 수 있습니다.\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</form>\n<div class=\"board-btnBox mt20 tr\">\n<a class=\"ty02\" href=\"#a\" id=\"btnSave\"><span>저장</span></a>\n<a class=\"ty01\" href=\"#a\" id=\"btnClose\"><span>취소</span></a>\n<!-- <li><a href=\"#a\" id=\"btnClose\" class=\"btn_rect02\">닫기</a></li> -->\n</div>\n</div><!-- pop-conts :: e -->\n<a class=\"pop-closed-btn\" href=\"#a\" id=\"btnClose2\">\n<span class=\"blinde\">팝업 닫기</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"public-dataBox\">\n<div class=\"pd-btm-box\">\n<h3 class=\"main-tit\">정보공개 항목별<br/> 공개자료 조회</h3>\n<div class=\"main-inputBox\">\n<form id=\"othbcIemLscrForm\" name=\"othbcIemLscrForm\">\n<select class=\"sel01\" id=\"operSeCode\" name=\"operSeCode\" onchange=\"loadLargeCategory(this.value);\" title=\"운영구분 선택\">\n<option value=\"0\">--운영구분--</option>\n<option value=\"100\">추진주체구성전</option>\n<option value=\"101\">추진위원회</option>\n<option value=\"102\">조합</option>\n<option value=\"103\">청산위원회</option>\n</select>\n<select class=\"sel01 main-input02\" id=\"largeCategoryIemSn\" name=\"largeCategoryIemSn\" onchange=\"loadSmallCategory(this.value);\" title=\"중분류 선택\">\n<option value=\"0\">-- 중분류 선택 --</option>\n</select>\n<select class=\"sel01 main-input02\" id=\"othbcIemSn\" name=\"othbcIemSn\" title=\"소분류 선택\">\n<option value=\"0\">-- 소분류 선택 --</option>\n</select>\n<button class=\"btn_search\" onclick=\"javascript:othbcIemLscrUrl();\" type=\"button\"><span>조회</span></button>\n</form>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tooltipBox\">\n<div class=\"tooltipIcon\"><span class=\"a11y\">툴팁 아이콘</span></div>\n<div class=\"txt\">정보공개 항목별로 공개된 자료들을 조회해 보실 수 있습니다.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-quickLink\">\n<div class=\"subLink-cont\">\n<div class=\"subLink-item\">\n<a href=\"/cafe/mastr-cleanup-bsnsSumry/execute.do?cafeId=740100001053I31&amp;stepSeCode=103&amp;div=sumry\"><span class=\"summary\">사업개요</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"subLink-item\">\n<a href=\"/cafe/mastr-cleanup-bsnsSumry/execute.do?cafeId=740100001053I31&amp;stepSeCode=103&amp;div=locImage\"><span class=\"location\">위치도</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"subLink-item\">\n<a href=\"/cafe/mastr-cleanup-bsnsSumry/execute.do?cafeId=740100001053I31&amp;stepSeCode=103&amp;div=sceImage\"><span class=\"perspective\">조감도</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"subLink-item\">\n<a href=\"/cafe/mastr-cleanup-bsnsSumry/execute.do?cafeId=740100001053I31&amp;stepSeCode=103&amp;div=posImage\"><span class=\"layout\">배치도</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"subLink-item\">\n<a href=\"/service/opendata/cafeOthbc/vscrCafe.do?cafeId=740100001053I31&amp;othbcIemSn=205\"><span class=\"unitplan\">단위세대<br/>평면도</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"subLink-item\">\n<a href=\"/cafe/cleanup-asscinfo/vscrAsscAdi.do?cafeId=740100001053I31\"><span class=\"direction\">찾아오시는길</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"subLink-cont view\">\n<div class=\"subLink-item\">\n<a href=\"/service/opendata/othbcDocSumry/lscr.do?cafeId=740100001053I31&amp;publicManage=103\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"opendata\">정보공개<br/>자료열람</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"subLink-item\">\n<a href=\"/cafe/mainIndx/cleanup-prtnelapse/vscr.do?cafeId=740100001053I31&amp;bsnsPk=11545-900000775\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"progress\">추진경과</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"subLink-item\">\n<a href=\"#n\" onclick=\"parent.Othbc.lscrOpen('218');\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"costchange\">공사비<br/>변경내역</span></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"subLink-item\">\n<a href=\"/assc/bbs-use/vscrScdl.do?cafeId=740100001053I31&amp;bbsSn=1\" tabindex=\"-1\"><span class=\"schedule\">향후일정</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"subLink-all-btn\">\n<a href=\"#n\" onclick=\"side_all_open(event)\"><span>전체보기</span></a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><!-- contents-wrap :: e -->\n</div><!-- inwrap :: e -->\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
